          "answer": "The listing minimum is 2 pairs. Indicative unit prices are USD 13.44 for 2-49 pairs, USD 12.54 for 50-99 pairs and USD 11.65 for 100 or more pairs. Final quotation depends on the color-size mix, packing, destination and agreed order terms; freight and any taxes are confirmed separately."
